    description: "Surfaced by the BROAD validation drain (session broad-20260706-153915, cohort-002/pretix + cohort-003/phoenix). axis_conformance violations blocking INV-numat's zero-violation closure gate: (1) Edge.evidence_type='module_qualified_call' is not in the evidence-type catalog (124 known) — ~512 edges, dominant on phoenix (elixir); (2) pass-id 'view-template-linker' appears on Edge.origin (~318), Symbol.origin (~292) and AnalysisRun.pass_id (~2) but is not in the pass-id catalog (182 known). Both point at a Phoenix view-template linker that emits an unregistered evidence_type and whose pass_id is uncataloged. Fix: register the evidence_type value (or fold to a canonical one) and register the pass-id. Cohort axis_conformance totals: pretix 611 / phoenix 515 / openzeppelin 519 / detekt 9 (this + the language-pollution sibling)."  # 97c5
